            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The activity starts with the battery cells, module packaging and the materials for additional components (esternal case, tabs, etc.) entering the factory gate. The activity ends with the production of Li-ion battery pack. Data is also from original LCI reference from Crenna et al (2021). Towards more flexibility and transparency in life cycle inventories for Lithium-ion batteries.; UUID: 678e731c-148d-3bb2-b3db-11423011f7ce</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
